  <body>
    <ul id="rtSample">
      <li id="s1">
        <p>Tags Sample</p>
        <ul>
          <li id="s2"><p>Click a pill to show every row with that tag. Press Command-Shift-T on any row to add a tag.</p></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li id="a1">
        <p>School</p>
        <ul>
          <li id="a2" data-type="task" data-tag="history">
            <p>HIST 210 Modern Europe</p>
            <ul>
              <li id="a3" data-type="task" data-tag="reading, history"><p>Read chapter 4 on the 1848 revolutions</p></li>
              <li id="a4" data-type="task" data-tag="assignment, history, writing"><p>Draft the response paper</p></li>
              <li id="a5" data-type="task" data-done="2026-10-20T15:00:00Z" data-tag="reading, history"><p>Read chapter 3</p></li>
              <li id="a6" data-type="task" data-tag="assignment, reading, history, writing, exam"><p>Annotate the primary sources for the midterm</p></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li id="a7">
            <p>Reading list</p>
            <ul>
              <li id="a8" data-tag="reading"><p>A field guide to the archives</p></li>
              <li id="a9" data-tag="reading, idea"><p>Essays on mapmaking</p></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li id="b1">
        <p>Home</p>
        <ul>
          <li id="b2" data-type="task" data-tag="errand"><p>Pick up the bike from the shop</p></li>
          <li id="b3" data-type="task" data-tag="idea, garden"><p>Sketch the raised bed layout</p></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li id="c1">
        <p>Old inline tags (try Convert Hash Tags)</p>
        <ul>
          <li id="c2"><p>Call the library about the interlibrary loan #waiting</p></li>
          <li id="c3"><p>#idea Podcast episode on local history #History</p></li>
          <li id="c4"><p>Renew the parking permit (#errand)</p></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </body>
</html>
